{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S06、S13的感受描述仍然偏密，连续扫读时不如X左右分栏来得直观，部分细节容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词让人很快抓住每段叙事的核心，话与感受交替排列，也更容易知道某种音乐表现对应人物哪一刻的心理变化；到时出现的提示进一步建立了音乐与情绪的对应关系。更重要的是，Y把人物从离开后的失落、怀念与抗拒，到重新理解自己的选择、决定带着想念继续生活的过程交代得更有层次，感受也更具体细腻。X的左右分栏有直观、便于横向扫视的优势，但右侧短词常常堆在一起，情绪与具体叙事节点之间的对应关系不够清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "49e7e633-1db5-45d0-ac78-8f2fe03043f6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T213712922770Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:38:12.306615+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "15692fb4672d85791fc49664178ef2d21d802ada767c9112ba5d5d1df1b295f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools